        "journey_title": "Where it all started",
        "journey_content": "<p>In 2020, during the height of the pandemic, stress and anxiety were at an all-time high. Stuck at home, our founder came across shower steamers—visually appealing but packed with cheap chemicals, making them impractical for everyday relaxation. Frustrated by the lack of a truly therapeutic option, body restore was born with the mission to deliver natural, therapeutic, and indulgent self care experiences. Made with real essential oils and packaged in eco-friendly, gift-ready designs, our shower steamers transform self-care into a simple, soothing ritual—one that’s meant to be shared with those who need it most.</p><p>\n\nToday, body restore is a rapidly growing personal care and wellness brand, recognized as the #1 shower steamer brand worldwide, with over 10 million customers served!</p><p>\n\nWe are committed to expanding beyond shower steamers and becoming the leading brand in everyday self-care, with natural, therapeutic, and indulgent experiences at our core. As stress and anxiety continue to affect daily life, we’re introducing new products across skincare, aromatherapy, sleep, and recovery to make high-quality self-care more accessible. By innovating across multiple categories, we aim to help people find moments of relaxation, balance, and wellness—anytime, anywhere.\n</p>"
